      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I went through all three quotes, plus I also got four quotes from other sources and the quote from cool green solar was the best value for money.They also offered the best after sales service and submit all the paper work to the appropriate people arrange for the new meter to be installed. Plus they arrange for the final electrical inspection as well as the original certificate of electrical safety and the electrical work request.  All this was included in the original quote, the only extra money I am required to outlay is the cost of the new bi-directional, or gross meter.It made it very easy for me every thing was done by them.  Even though it has not all been finalized as yet, I can for see no problems and am extremely happy with the way things have gone so far.  Thank you very much for your help.+",
