      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I had a bad experience with UnLeash Solar. They stuffed me around. Wayne from Cool Green Solar, continued to answer my questions in a timely fashion before the sale. Since I paid the deposit contact has been scarce. I had a scoping visit from someone (Myer I believe) they were supposed to call me before they arrive to let me talk with them but they never did. I rang and spoke with Hayley at their office and she told me that the people who were doing the scoping had been and already filed their report.I have not heard from anyone since. It would be nice to have a followup call from Wayne or someone to let me know where we are at in the proceedings. I as a customer would like to know that my deposit is safely in the hands of a reputable company. With so many scams around these day, just an assuring phone call would be nice.As for the quality of the product, as I can only judge on the information given, I must reserve my comments until the item is installed.",
